url: "https://rawthoughts.in"
abstract: >-
  Scope gives agent sessions the context to continue earlier work. Source
  owners supply secret-free snapshots and retain access to the originals.
  The design selects fresh context within the request's size limit and signs
  the resulting bundle, with each item's sources, age and omissions explained.
  This repository holds the scope-kernel Rust library and the system design;
  the context service, resolver and command line are not implemented.
keywords:
  - agent-memory
  - context-resolution
  - organizational-intelligence
  - agentic-systems
